be so important in South Korea.

00:18:13.080 --> 00:18:15.590
So I had to start learning my third
language.

00:18:15.590 --> 00:18:20.080
While I was studying for

00:18:20.080 --> 00:18:24.580
the university entrance exam, suddenly,
one day, everything changed.

00:18:27.050 --> 00:18:31.870
I heard that my family in North Korea had
a serious problem by the government, so

00:18:31.870 --> 00:18:36.100
I had no choice but to risk my life by
helping them to escape.

00:18:38.550 --> 00:18:40.230
I went back to China and

00:18:40.230 --> 00:18:45.030
I secretly awaited my family on the
Chinese border with North Korea.

00:18:45.030 --> 00:18:51.160
After 14 years, I would finally see my
family for the first time in person.

00:18:51.160 --> 00:18:57.785
My mother had faked her own death and paid
a doctor to forge the death certificate,

00:18:57.785 --> 00:19:04.140
while my brother used his connections to
the border guards to get them across.

00:19:05.460 --> 00:19:10.910
When I finally met them on the Chinese
border with North Korea, I was really

00:19:10.910 --> 00:19:18.880
excited, but we couldn't even embrace each
other for fear of getting caught.

00:19:18.880 --> 00:19:22.299
So until we got to the hotel, we didn't
say any word.

00:19:25.290 --> 00:19:27.580
After we were finally safe in hotel, I was
so

00:19:27.580 --> 00:19:33.110
sad because my mom and brother looked
fearful.

00:19:33.110 --> 00:19:36.830
They were soaking wet and shivering.

00:19:36.830 --> 00:19:41.632
And especially my mom looked very old.

00:19:41.632 --> 00:19:44.390
She told me the stress was almost
unbearable.

00:19:45.390 --> 00:19:48.350
We couldn't stop crying and hugging and

00:19:48.350 --> 00:19:53.580
stay up whole night to talking and I told
them, full details of my plan.

00:19:53.580 --> 00:19:56.540
We would travel China by bus, and

00:19:56.540 --> 00:20:00.960
then cross border into Laos, and then seek
asylum in Soska embassy.

00:20:02.280 --> 00:20:06.080
We stayed a few more days, so everyone
could regain our energy.

00:20:06.080 --> 00:20:09.200
But we didn't have much time to waste.

00:20:09.200 --> 00:20:13.000
We had a long and journey ahead of us.

00:20:13.000 --> 00:20:20.610
The day we choose to depart was a horrible
day, and at the time I didn't know that.

00:20:20.610 --> 00:20:22.380
It was China's National Day,

00:20:22.380 --> 00:20:29.050
so there was a huge Chinese police
presence taking IDs on all the buses.

00:20:29.050 --> 00:20:31.990
Within the first five minute depart,
depart-,

00:20:31.990 --> 00:20:35.419
departure, our bus was stopped, for the
inspections.

00:20:37.810 --> 00:20:43.293
The military soldier boarded, and he's
starting taking ids,

00:20:43.293 --> 00:20:49.906
while he's looking at, it's, pa,
passengers' eyes, in, in the eyes.

00:20:49.906 --> 00:20:54.213
I couldn't believe our bad luck.

00:20:54.213 --> 00:20:57.599
My brother, he was only unfortunately,

00:20:57.599 --> 00:21:02.062
he was the only male passenger on the bus,
at the time.

00:21:02.062 --> 00:21:06.298
And he was also stood out since he's thin
he has, he was thinner and

00:21:06.298 --> 00:21:11.535
he had the darker skin colors compared to
the other Chinese men in his, in his age.

00:21:11.535 --> 00:21:14.299
Because North Koreans, we never used any
sun cream.

00:21:16.010 --> 00:21:18.290
And he pretend to be a slave but

00:21:18.290 --> 00:21:23.190
are, so the soldier are walking directly
towards my brother.

00:21:24.480 --> 00:21:29.920
My heart found, pounding was so fast and
in myself, I found myself in panic.

00:21:29.920 --> 00:21:36.190
I knew if I don't do anything in that
situation, it will not probably end well.

00:21:36.190 --> 00:21:39.180
I had to do something, but what?

00:21:39.180 --> 00:21:42.800
I froze, and my heart and my body turned
to stone.

00:21:43.990 --> 00:21:48.520
As the soldier approach I was, kept asking
myself what can I do?

00:21:48.520 --> 00:21:49.200
What can I do?

00:21:50.580 --> 00:21:54.600
The guard was so close now, and just a few
more steps left.

00:21:56.090 --> 00:21:59.442
And so then I found the answer and

00:21:59.442 --> 00:22:03.770
[UNKNOWN] in front of him and I put the
cameras in his face.

00:22:03.770 --> 00:22:06.110
And I started taking pictures of him.

00:22:06.110 --> 00:22:09.460
He became, he was stunned and I,

00:22:09.460 --> 00:22:13.519
and I started taking more pictures of him
and I, and he became furious.

00:22:15.060 --> 00:22:19.250
Don't you know it's illegal to take
pictures in this kind of situation he

00:22:19.250 --> 00:22:25.620
yelled, in Chinese, so I gave an innocent
smile and said

00:22:25.620 --> 00:22:30.950
I'm sorry I didn't know it's illegal since
I've never seen anything like this before.

00:22:30.950 --> 00:22:33.090
I will delete them right away.

00:22:33.090 --> 00:22:37.320
And every passengers on the bus was
staring at us between him and

00:22:37.320 --> 00:22:42.660
he was flustered and turned around and he
ran off of the bus.

00:22:44.820 --> 00:22:50.249
I was so relieved, but the long and
difficult journey had just begun.

00:22:52.280 --> 00:22:57.380
After the long, after the first bus ride,
we took a short break.

00:22:57.380 --> 00:23:00.590
And we started another long bus ride.

00:23:00.590 --> 00:23:04.370
That would take between 16 to 18 hours.

00:23:05.790 --> 00:23:07.450
Again, our bus was stopped.

00:23:09.500 --> 00:23:12.310
Eight hours later, after the departure.

00:23:12.310 --> 00:23:15.100
This time, there was a Chinese police
officer.

00:23:15.100 --> 00:23:16.807
He demanded all the Chine-,

00:23:16.807 --> 00:23:19.440
all the passengers' id cards.

00:23:19.440 --> 00:23:26.380
And questioning names and asking questions
like, where is your home town?

00:23:28.210 --> 00:23:29.380
Where are you going?

00:23:29.380 --> 00:23:31.380
And why are you going there?

00:23:31.380 --> 00:23:31.880
Like this.

00:23:33.090 --> 00:23:38.640
It's obvious that he is looking for chi,
North Korean defectors.

00:23:41.000 --> 00:23:41.870
My heart sank.
Even though my mom and

00:23:41.870 --> 00:23:45.580
brother have a Chinese i d cards that I
borrowed from some Chinese, but

00:23:45.580 --> 00:23:50.870
they can't speak Chinese at the time, so.

00:23:52.480 --> 00:23:57.110
Soon my brother's fake name was called,
the Chinese police

00:23:57.110 --> 00:24:00.800
officer demanded my brother to come up to
the front to meet him.

00:24:02.580 --> 00:24:08.460
My brother just froze and I noticed his
face turned completely dark.

00:24:08.460 --> 00:24:11.149
It was like nothing I've ever seen like
this before.

00:24:13.610 --> 00:24:17.350
He called my brother's name second time
and then a third.

00:24:17.350 --> 00:24:24.520
He was clearly annoyed.

00:24:24.520 --> 00:24:27.570
And I just pushed on my brother to get
off.

00:24:27.570 --> 00:24:31.840
But I, saw my brother was shaking with a
fear.

00:24:31.840 --> 00:24:36.900
It was a really hurt me at the time, so I
spring into another action once again.

00:24:38.630 --> 00:24:45.060
I told the police officer, he's deaf and
dump, and I'm his chaperone.

00:24:46.070 --> 00:24:49.309
He looked at me with suspicious and in
disbelief.

00:24:50.500 --> 00:24:54.850
As I was just trying to explain, I heard
grunting noise behind me.

00:24:54.850 --> 00:25:02.730
It was my mom, pretending to, pretending
to be a mentally challenged person.

00:25:02.730 --> 00:25:05.690
&gt;&gt; [LAUGH].

00:25:05.690 --> 00:25:07.938
&gt;&gt; She's with me too, I said.

00:25:07.938 --> 00:25:12.610
She's also deaf and dumb.

00:25:12.610 --> 00:25:14.340
I told the police officer.

00:25:14.340 --> 00:25:20.024
He looked absolutely shocked and after an
awkward silence,

00:25:20.024 --> 00:25:26.190
he mumbled, there are too many deaf and
dumb people on this bus.

00:25:26.190 --> 00:25:34.833
And he turned around to the bus driver and

00:25:34.833 --> 00:25:39.400
ticket taker, he asked, is this true?

00:25:39.400 --> 00:25:43.380
And those two person was visibly annoyed
by the long delays and

00:25:44.390 --> 00:25:47.350
quickly assured him that it was indeed
true.

00:25:47.350 --> 00:25:47.989
He looked at me in disbelief.

00:25:49.130 --> 00:25:52.640
He got off the bus, and we started to move
again.

00:25:54.230 --> 00:26:00.210
As my family and I returned to our seat,
every single passenger was staring at us.

00:26:01.510 --> 00:26:06.240
At the time it occurred to me, actually my
family and

00:26:06.240 --> 00:26:10.020
I had been talking Korean the entire time.

00:26:10.020 --> 00:26:11.710
So every passenger in the bus.

00:26:11.710 --> 00:26:15.130
They know that my mom and brother weren't
deaf and dumb.

00:26:16.320 --> 00:26:20.180
But amazingly, they didn't say anything.

00:26:20.180 --> 00:26:23.930
It was another miraculous moment in the
journey.

00:26:23.930 --> 00:26:29.560
And I'm so thankful to those passengers,
that they didn't expose us.

00:26:29.560 --> 00:26:34.266
So, for the rest of the journey three of
us

00:26:34.266 --> 00:26:40.057
sat in silence and even after the bus ride
was over.

00:26:40.057 --> 00:26:48.799
The overcoming stress made us too
difficult to talk to each other.

00:26:48.799 --> 00:26:55.309
After the two, after dodging two huge
bullets on the previous ride,

00:26:55.309 --> 00:27:00.696
I decided to quickly move to the last part
of the journey,

00:27:00.696 --> 00:27:04.190
and we took yet another bus to Sauze.

00:27:04.190 --> 00:27:07.140
Now we had traveled more than thousands of
kilometers

00:27:07.140 --> 00:27:11.270
from the snow capped mountains of
Northeastern China into the [INAUDIBLE].

00:27:11.270 --> 00:27:19.359
As we approached the near the border,

00:27:19.359 --> 00:27:25.160
we felt growing sense of excitement, since
the end seemed to be,

00:27:25.160 --> 00:27:26.780
seemed to be in site.

00:27:28.660 --> 00:27:34.570
However, the journey had heat, had to take
its toll and three

00:27:35.840 --> 00:27:41.320
of us lost a lot of weight and couldn't
cope well with the scorching heat.

00:27:41.320 --> 00:27:46.160
Our energy was nearly depleted, when
finally pulled into the last bus station,

00:27:47.190 --> 00:27:48.350
near the border.

00:27:48.350 --> 00:27:54.420
I had arranged the, for the brokers, so he
could take my family to the,

00:27:54.420 --> 00:27:57.050
into the Laos since I don't know the way.

00:27:57.050 --> 00:28:01.690
I met him at the last bus station and we
said our goodbyes and

00:28:01.690 --> 00:28:07.790
I told my family I will, I will see them
soon back in South Korea.

00:28:07.790 --> 00:28:12.182
I reassured them and exhausted, we parted
ways.

00:28:12.182 --> 00:28:14.551
[BLANK_AUDIO]

00:28:14.551 --> 00:28:18.220
In the next morning I took a taxi.

00:28:18.220 --> 00:28:21.720
I thought my job was done, but

00:28:21.720 --> 00:28:25.890
just as I was approaching the airport, my
cell phone rang.

00:28:28.430 --> 00:28:31.890
Your family was called after crossing the
border into Laos, and

00:28:31.890 --> 00:28:36.847
they are probably taken to the prison in
[UNKNOWN].

00:28:36.847 --> 00:28:37.990
It was a broker.

00:28:40.160 --> 00:28:42.610
Wrong what I asked.

00:28:42.610 --> 00:28:47.700
I never even heard what the Laos until I
started planning this journey, and

00:28:47.700 --> 00:28:50.359
certainly I don't know anything about the
country.

00:28:51.860 --> 00:28:56.800
He said in the past the captured, North
Korean defectors were taken to there and

00:28:56.800 --> 00:29:01.560
it's about 40 kilometers from inside, from
the border.

00:29:01.560 --> 00:29:04.760
And he said he couldn't hear me anymore
and he just hung up the phone.

00:29:08.730 --> 00:29:12.670
My head started spinning and the energy
zipped out of my body and

00:29:12.670 --> 00:29:14.258
I slumped into the seat.

00:29:14.258 --> 00:29:18.950
Immobilized by hopelessness.

00:29:18.950 --> 00:29:24.560
And I told the taxi driver to turn around
and to go to the border area.

00:29:27.360 --> 00:29:34.458
Now I am going to go and I asked some
random people for the directions and

00:29:34.458 --> 00:29:41.093
finally looked at the border areas of Lao
immigration building.

00:29:41.093 --> 00:29:46.429
Looking to the mountains around the
border, I was guess, I was trying to

00:29:46.429 --> 00:29:51.593
guess which mountain my family had crossed
because I wanted to have a,

00:29:51.593 --> 00:29:57.043
some kind of feeling, to connect that they
are still, are still near me.

00:29:57.043 --> 00:29:59.927
I was in a cab looking at the mountains,
and

00:29:59.927 --> 00:30:03.773
I was trying to connect my brother and my
mum to Seoul, and

00:30:03.773 --> 00:30:10.320
I couldn't stop thinking if I would have a
chance to meet them again in my lifetime.

00:30:10.320 --> 00:30:13.909
Maybe their souls were lost on the
mountain that day.

00:30:16.050 --> 00:30:19.729
Finally, I walked across to the
immigration line and

00:30:19.729 --> 00:30:23.174
I noticed a pole, one man was standing
behind me.

00:30:23.174 --> 00:30:29.250
And we took the same bus to the [UNKNOWN]
but I didn't pay any attention to him.

00:30:29.250 --> 00:30:33.020
Little did I know this man would soon
change my life.

00:30:36.160 --> 00:30:40.810
After arriving in [UNKNOWN], I spent four
weeks between, going back and

00:30:40.810 --> 00:30:43.650
forth between the law immigration and

00:30:43.650 --> 00:30:50.580
police station to, desparatingly trying to
make negotiate my family's release.

00:30:50.580 --> 00:30:55.130
I bribed them every days, but they, the
authorities wouldn't release them.

00:30:55.130 --> 00:30:59.420
And one day, after many days later they
told me if I

00:30:59.420 --> 00:31:05.290
pay fine per person, with the US dollar,
then they can release my family.

00:31:05.290 --> 00:31:09.740
But at that time my cash was running very
low because already I k,

00:31:09.740 --> 00:31:12.530
borrowed, twice from a friend in South
Korea.

00:31:12.530 --> 00:31:18.410
I just went to coffee shop to think what
to do, well,

00:31:18.410 --> 00:31:20.340
I could not find any good options.

00:31:21.920 --> 00:31:25.950
I was so depressed and the whole world
seemed so dark.

00:31:27.620 --> 00:31:33.470
But luckily, a bright ray of sunshine came
into my life when I needed it most.

00:31:35.720 --> 00:31:38.831
Excuse me, are you a traveler?

00:31:38.831 --> 00:31:41.643
I just to wondered if people live stay
here for

00:31:41.643 --> 00:31:44.160
a few days while I saw you a few weeks
ago.

00:31:44.160 --> 00:31:47.960
He was the po white man from the bus.

00:31:49.290 --> 00:31:52.350
I only knew a little English, and even
though I couldn't completely understand

00:31:52.350 --> 00:31:56.060
him, but we started communicating with my
cell phone dictionary.

00:31:57.480 --> 00:32:04.142
After he heard my story, he looked quite
surprised.

00:32:04.142 --> 00:32:11.155
And he made quick phone call with his
friend and he told me he wouldn't hurt me.

00:32:11.155 --> 00:32:14.220
I couldn't believe what I was hearing.

00:32:14.220 --> 00:32:17.179
Why would a total stranger be help us like
this?

00:32:18.550 --> 00:32:22.500
So many people in my life have been
deceitful and manipulative.

00:32:24.540 --> 00:32:26.780
Please wait for me here, he said.

00:32:26.780 --> 00:32:29.890
I wasn't even sure if he would come back.

00:32:31.140 --> 00:32:37.850
But, soon he come back with a fist full of
cash, By the way, my name is Dick.

00:32:37.850 --> 00:32:43.740
Then, then it hit me, I even didn't know,

00:32:43.740 --> 00:32:47.210
I even hadn't known his name.

00:32:47.210 --> 00:32:51.996
Eventually we went to prison together and
released my family and

00:32:51.996 --> 00:32:55.995
three other North Koreans came from the
same prison.

00:32:55.995 --> 00:33:00.778
My mother, for us to look them in, in
disbelief.

00:33:00.778 --> 00:33:04.935
And then run like the wind to embrace me.

00:33:04.935 --> 00:33:10.091
She was sobbing and awful, she looked very
awful.

00:33:10.091 --> 00:33:12.434
But at least we were together again.

00:33:12.434 --> 00:33:17.640
After that I decided to bribe, to pay some
police official.

00:33:17.640 --> 00:33:22.890
So we could get a ride to capital of Laos
without being stopped.

00:33:22.890 --> 00:33:24.870
But eventually we were betrayed.

00:33:26.760 --> 00:33:31.730
Instead of taking us to the [UNKNOWN]
embassy, they handed us to off,

00:33:31.730 --> 00:33:34.300
some security officers.

00:33:34.300 --> 00:33:37.129
For arrested my mom and brother once
again.

00:33:39.640 --> 00:33:47.240
Then, stunningly, I was interrogated,
accused of human trafficking for merely

00:33:47.240 --> 00:33:53.270
trying to help North Koreans reach safety,
and I, ordered to pay another fine.

00:33:53.270 --> 00:33:58.770
The officers on Laos were exploiting us in
every way possible.

00:33:58.770 --> 00:34:00.940
I finally resolved the,

00:34:00.940 --> 00:34:06.322
the issue by even more borrowing from a
friend in South Korea.

00:34:06.322 --> 00:34:12.279
And I had to leave the country immediately
while my family rotten in prison for

00:34:12.279 --> 00:34:14.121
another three months.

00:34:14.121 --> 00:34:16.180
And followed by three more months waiting
in South Korean embassy.

00:34:18.136 --> 00:34:24.636
After my finally, my family finally
arrived in South Korea,

00:34:24.636 --> 00:34:28.761
they had to spend a total of six months in

00:34:28.761 --> 00:34:33.651
interrogation center and [UNKNOWN]
facility.

00:34:33.651 --> 00:34:37.108
So, in total, I had to wait a full year
after leaving Laos until I

00:34:37.108 --> 00:34:38.849
could finally meet them again.

00:34:41.660 --> 00:34:49.150
After arriving in South Korea, I thought
about the kind, Australian man, [UNKNOWN].

00:34:49.150 --> 00:34:51.780
After he paid the fine for my family,

00:34:51.780 --> 00:34:56.910
then he found out that I didn't even have
enough money to go back to South Korea, so

00:34:56.910 --> 00:34:59.368
even he paid my airplane ticket, at the
time.

00:34:59.368 --> 00:35:06.660
So I thanked him with all of my heart and
I asked him why are you helping me.

00:35:06.660 --> 00:35:10.630
I'm not helping you, he said, I'm helping
[UNKNOWN] people.

00:35:10.630 --> 00:35:15.923
His good deeds changed my life completely.

00:35:15.923 --> 00:35:20.340
Before meeting him I thought the whole
world was so cold to me.

00:35:20.340 --> 00:35:26.532
But at the moment I realized that the life
is still worth living and I believed

00:35:26.532 --> 00:35:32.550
that the answers not only in novels or
movies that their working among us.

00:35:32.550 --> 00:35:35.412
It was a huge realization for me and

00:35:35.412 --> 00:35:39.378
because of his actions I got to where I am
today.

00:35:39.378 --> 00:35:46.130
Unfortunately we lost contact after I left
Laos, but

00:35:46.130 --> 00:35:50.860
amazingly he saw my TED talk last year, so
he was able to contact me once again.

00:35:50.860 --> 00:35:54.517
So we were eventually reunited on an
Australian TV show, and

00:35:54.517 --> 00:35:57.325
we are still talking to each other these
days.

00:35:57.325 --> 00:36:02.433
[BLANK_AUDIO]

00:36:02.433 --> 00:36:07.984
Most [INAUDIBLE] have experienced a lot of
pain, and we are sometimes awkward

00:36:07.984 --> 00:36:12.511
in the outside world, since we lived such
a sheltered lives.

00:36:12.511 --> 00:36:16.430
And, but still we are doing our best to
laugh and sometimes at ourselves.

00:36:19.120 --> 00:36:23.560
One time a North Korean [INAUDIBLE]
friend, she started eating an unpeeled

00:36:23.560 --> 00:36:27.700
banana in public, since she never seen
anything like that before.

00:36:29.890 --> 00:36:34.828
As everyone around her was [UNKNOWN] and
stopped, she felt so

00:36:34.828 --> 00:36:39.778
embarrassed, but now it’s a funny
[INAUDIBLE] between us.

00:36:39.778 --> 00:36:44.261
My mom also had some funny moments since
arriving in South Korea.

00:36:44.261 --> 00:36:49.460
The very first day of freedom in South
Korea, my mom and

00:36:49.460 --> 00:36:55.226
I went to an ATM to withdraw some cash to
buying some clothes,

00:36:55.226 --> 00:36:57.730
but she just stood there.

00:36:59.030 --> 00:37:01.202
She's staring at the machine for a while.

00:37:01.202 --> 00:37:04.501
So I asked my mom and a, mom, what are you
doing?

00:37:04.501 --> 00:37:08.354
And she said, I can't understand this
machine.

00:37:08.354 --> 00:37:11.211
How is the money come to the so fast?

00:37:11.211 --> 00:37:14.207
And how even the worker fit inside?

00:37:14.207 --> 00:37:19.650
[LAUGH] The little man has to work there
all day?

00:37:19.650 --> 00:37:20.575
And even without a window.

00:37:20.575 --> 00:37:25.380
[LAUGH] I just burst out laughing and

